icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Planguy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1516193-some-aspects-of-the-game-are-actively-hurting-the-adventure-possibilities?p=1518255#post1518255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why not? The Teragen is a player faction and they can be anything between people who simply believe that Nova's are fundamentally different from, and should be treated different to, baseline humanity and Nova supremacist terrorists.<br /> <br /> An Allegiance that has both heroic scholars going on adventures and shadowy individuals pulling their strings and slipping their own agents into the group seems cool. The heroic PC of the Ponatowski Foundation would be like Indiana Jones working for Walter Donovan. The Ponatowski Foundation could be either a protagonist or an antagonist faction.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm. You raise a good point.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-05T08:20:14-07:00","id":1519866,"title":"","content":"But, The Teragen is not presented as a strictly villainous organization, just one that promotes and extreme ideology. Ponatowski was presented as a group run by villains doing things for villainous ends, playing at being any other exploration organization when public was looking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-05T09:45:29-07:00","id":1519875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slagheap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1516193-some-aspects-of-the-game-are-actively-hurting-the-adventure-possibilities?p=1519866#post1519866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But, The Teragen is not presented as a strictly villainous organization, just one that promotes and extreme ideology. Ponatowski was presented as a group run by villains doing things for villainous ends, playing at being any other exploration organization when public was looking.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also a very good point! That\u2019s why I was initially opposed to the Ponatowski Foundation being a PC Allegiance.<br /> <br /> Interesting trivia. In the late 18th century, Ponatowski was the last name of the last king of the independent kingdom of Poland before it was swallowed by Napoleon and later by Russia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-05T11:08:34-07:00","id":1519886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NullApostle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1516193-some-aspects-of-the-game-are-actively-hurting-the-adventure-possibilities?p=1519855#post1519855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Published fan works under the Onyx Path banner.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_32938/StoryPath-Nexus\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/...toryPath-Nexus</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Gotcha thought it probably was, but wanted to check I hadn\u2019t missed a different repository.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27824-arcanus","name":"Arcanus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27824_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T11:09:53-07:00","id":1520689,"title":"","content":"In the original Adventure! The Ponatowski Foundations evil was hidden, and all the better for the organization for it to be so. They would have highly effective heroes working for them that didn't think they were doing anything other then going on archeological expeditions. The Foundation was also not very centralized, so you might have figures like Marcus Brody in it who are funding expeditions that are completely legit.<br /> <br /> My ideal situation wouldn't be for the Foundation to be always the bad guys, it would be for a PC group of heroic Foundation affiliated scholars to be going up against a rival group of villainous Foundation scholars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}